{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTRO AMIGO</strong> is a story-driven sci-fi adventure game where you explore a strange Wisconsin town, investigate its secrets, play mini-games, and make story-shaping choices as young  Austin searches for his missing dog, Amigo.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A MYSTERY  SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a heartfelt coming-of-age story full of mystery, humor, and small-town strangeness. Explore Sidgrove, meet its oddball residents, and uncover the truth behind Amigo\u2019s disappearance as something otherworldly lurks beneath the surface. Your choices guide the story and determine one of multiple endings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADVENTUROUS MINI-GAMES AND PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a narrative game. It\u2019s a blast of adventure gameplay and nostalgic mini-games: epic chases, paranormal searches and sightings, cryptic puzzles, school gym dodgeball,  catch with Amigo, and more!     </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, supernatural story shaped by your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi adventure gameplay full of  charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quirky mini-games and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted pixel art paired with an  original synth soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with love by a  two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming summer 2026.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577850?t=1766633177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/8ccb30faa36aaab57abba24fc636239b72d93ded/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766633177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap